OL,3,GNEWSAMP Carla Lockhart quits DUP in
OL,4,ADrumcree row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fall-out comes after unionist anger
OL,7,Fover Sinn Fein's involvement in
OL,8,Fprotests on Garvaghy Road, which
OL,9,Fblocked a contentious Orange Order
OL,10,Fparade from passing along the mainly
OL,11,Fnationalist street in Portadown, County
OL,12,FArmagh.
